<title>SPAIN: Spain's GESA net '96 profit 8.38 bln pta.</title>
<headline>Spain's GESA net '96 profit 8.38 bln pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Spanish electricity firm GESA for 1996 (in billions of pesetas unless otherwise specified):</p>
<p>					     1996	1995</p>
<p>     Net turnover			57.93    55.29</p>
<p>     Operating profit		  13.47    11.85</p>
<p>     Ordinary profit		   12.02    11.17</p>
<p>     Pre-tax profit		    12.01    11.23</p>
<p>     Net profit			   8.38    8.28</p>
<p>By 1245 GMT, Gesa's shares were trading 10 pesetas up at 7,760.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2161</p>
</text>
